Z||000004||rogergarrison||11-23-2001||07:24 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DaRkLoRD:<BR><B>How much do vette shift knobs cost? looks nice!<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Ive got an Eklers Corvette catalog I use to buy parts for customers. Theve got a pretty big choice of stuff, even real carbon fiber stuff. auto shift knobs start at $39/w button<BR>Theres at least a dozen different types. Im not going to the dark side, still love my Ferraro. This is just my in town, automatic, gofur car. And now owning both, I can tell you the Ferraro will blow the doors off of this.<P><p>[This message has been edited by rogergarrison (edited 11-23-2001).]||||reg||1
