Z||000012||rogergarrison||11-24-2001||04:40 AM||||tks for the compliments. I painted it that color to be different. Cam gets colors a little off, in person its greener, interior is tanner. I didnt want 2 red cars and Ferraris just HAVE to be red. Its 88. I was looking for months for a Fiero auto, and a kit to have something to do while I hibernate for winter, but fell into this at a price I couldnt pass up on. A pleasant surprise is this thing gets more than double the gas milage of the Ferraro. Maybe this Vette thing isnt so bad, Ive only got to drive it 1 day now, and already had a girl at a gas station walk over, start chatting, and checking it out <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">. The radio dont work but tape player does, so yes theres a Brit tape already in it.||||reg||1
